ob_data (["long":"@@query_long","c_short":"@@query_c_short","short":"@@query_short","name":"board","c_cap_name":"留言板","long.text":"This is a bulletin board. For information on how to use it, use `help board'.","c_name":"留言板","cap_name":"Board","silent_look":1,"last_location":0,"short.text":"Healer's bulletin board","c_long.text":"这是一个留言板，专供人留言纪事。详细用法请看 help board。","c_long":"@@query_c_long","id":({"board","bulletin board",}),"c_short.text":"行医者留言板",])
messages ({(["id":116,"body":"On Wed Sep 28, Noria wrote:> 	Js :> > 		你真的戌蛘□F? 唉! ....[B        Noria :                你在说啥.....看不懂ㄋㄟ.......:)                                    八云","title":"Re: < no title >","time":780754363,"poster":"Jschen",]),(["id":117,"body":"On Tue Sep 27, Annihilator wrote:> Hi healers:>     Just added a new skill *grin* to make medicines, it is called> medical(药物调配). You can buy herb bowl from Medic Wang and make> medicines. The chance to succeed depend on your medical skill and> how difficulty the medicine can be made.> >     Test it and report if any bug.> > PS/ The medicine you made is better than you can bought. They cause>     no sick and may have varies advantages.> >                                                   - Annihilator  呵呵...果然很好玩....:)  希望 Annihilator 能再多造一些药材.....  至於配药的方法....除了问 Wang 外..  最好特殊的药也能用特殊的方法得知...:)  例如..如果要知道天香断序膏的话...要 flog wang 十次...:P    嘿....我突然想到练妖壶......*grin*  不管怎样...希望 Annihilator 多加油...让 healer 能更好玩...:P                                                  杜杜鸟","title":"Re: About herbs","time":780768532,"poster":"Tutu",]),(["id":118,"body":"On Wed Sep 28, Callman wrote:> 我须要解毒丹呐...........> 神医都自杀了吗??> 医生现在可作作小本生意, 卖卖解毒丹, 成本我是不知多少, 我卖给商店老板是20 silver> 所以今天Hch 说一粒解毒丹30 silver 我是觉得差不多,....> 不过现在线上没神医啦  :(~~> 可不可以请你们卖一些到商店里, ..........> > >                            想闯毒虫穴的Callman> >    天啊...30 silver 叫差不多.... 你知道要做一个解毒丹要哪些东西吗?? 光是那三个药材每个 10 silver 就要 30 silver 了.. 再加上药钵 100 silver .... 还有技能不够还会失败..... 加一加....30 是赔钱卖耶..... 要是真的要卖...我觉得至少要 50 silver 喔...:P                                         杜杜鸟","title":"Re: about 解毒丹!!","time":780768761,"poster":"Tutu",]),(["id":119,"body":"","title":"< no title >","time":780796780,"poster":"Bamboo",]),(["id":120,"body":"","title":"< no title >","time":780796786,"poster":"Bamboo",]),(["id":121,"body":"","title":"< no title >","time":780796788,"poster":"Bamboo",]),(["id":122,"body":"","title":"< no title >","tim